 "topic": "Free early helicopter: a Buckingham Maverick on the helipad at the end of a dock in Southwind, about 2.5 miles from Jason's house in Key Lento (west on the highway through Abismo Key); open gate, ignore the sign; no mission, no guards, no wanted level",
